type: software
title: "Entrepreneur Business Intelligence & CFO"
version: "2.2.0"
date-released: "2026-08-20"
abstract: >-
  An AI skill (SKILL.md architecture) that acts as a practical CFO, growth
  strategist, and operations analyst for founders and small businesses. It
  runs a fixed Extract, Validate, Calculate, Reconcile, Diagnose, Stress-test,
  Recommend pipeline on every financial question rather than reciting ratio
  definitions, offloads arithmetic to a deterministic Python calculator,
  ships a 90-formula live Excel dashboard, and defaults to Bangladeshi Taka
  with support for 34 currencies and South Asian lakh/crore digit grouping.
  Includes a SHA-256 signed integrity manifest and is portable across
  Claude, OpenAI Custom GPTs, Cursor, Windsurf, GitHub Copilot, Gemini Gems,
  and AGENTS.md-compatible agents.
